@startuml Create new collection by user
actor User
participant ": CollectionPage " as CollectionPage
participant ": Router " as Router
participant ": CollectionController " as CollectionController
participant ": CollectionService " as CollectionService
participant ": CollectionRepository " as CollectionRepository
database Database

User->CollectionPage: 1. Enter collection name and click "Tạo mới"
    activate User
    activate CollectionPage

CollectionPage->CollectionPage: 2. Validate collection name

alt valid name
    CollectionPage->Router: 10.1 Send POST /api/collection with CreateCollectionDto
    deactivate CollectionPage
    activate Router

    Router->CollectionController: 10.1.1 Route Request to Controller
    deactivate Router
    activate CollectionController

    CollectionController->CollectionController: 10.1.2 Get current user from token

    CollectionController->CollectionService: 10.1.3 CreateCollectionResponse(user, dto)
    deactivate CollectionController
    activate CollectionService

    CollectionService->CollectionService: 10.1.4 Create FavoriteCollection entity

    CollectionService->CollectionRepository: 10.1.5 AddAsync(collection)
    activate CollectionRepository

    CollectionRepository->Database: 10.1.6 INSERT FavoriteCollection into database
    activate Database

    Database-->CollectionRepository: 10.1.7 Collection Created Successfully
    deactivate Database

    CollectionRepository-->CollectionService: 10.1.8 Return
    deactivate CollectionRepository

    CollectionService->CollectionService: 10.1.9 Map to CollectionResponseDto

    CollectionService-->CollectionController: 10.1.10 Return CollectionResponseDto
    activate CollectionController
    deactivate CollectionService

    CollectionController-->Router: 10.1.11 Send Success Response (200)
    activate Router
    deactivate CollectionController

    Router-->CollectionPage: 10.1.12 Collection Created Successfully
    activate CollectionPage
    deactivate Router

    CollectionPage->CollectionPage: 10.1.13 Refresh collections list
    CollectionPage-->User: 10.1.14 Show Success Toast
    deactivate CollectionPage
    deactivate User
else invalid name
    CollectionPage->CollectionPage: 10.2 Show error (Name cannot be empty)
    CollectionPage-->User: 10.2.1 Show error toast
    deactivate CollectionPage
    deactivate User
end
@enduml

